{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_010_jp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_010_jp_01_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "07fe5d456ddd55b187abd2b6b413780602747709b2b0e81e3cbd50b8d6e2dfc2", "ja": "ねえ……歩さん、今のじゃない？", "zh": "呐……步姐，刚才那个不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
