{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_010_jp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_010_jp_01_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "eaa5ef0fd4faccc120702f253ce0681fbfa8b187c5d3fb49ccd831a8e6f05fd9", "ja": "感想だよ、感想！　すごく自然じゃなかったか？\nな、ロコ！", "zh": "是感想啊，感想！刚才不是特别自然吗？\n对吧，ROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "offer_010_jp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_010_jp_01_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "5de303342b0b51978b9883909884c268ec383b7c88432315f72e1a43af2881a1", "ja": "はい、グッドでした！\nアユム、今の感じでいきましょう！", "zh": "嗯，很棒！\n步，接下来就保持现在的感觉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
